    "en": "Jimaodanus-inspired preserved algal axis fragment only, with lower branched hairlike whorls in a fine secondary branching tier and an upper subapical crown of thicker simple unbranched clavate laterals. Two distinct branch types, not duplicated branches with changed density. Historical Heterocladus name retained as nomenclatural context only; no roots, unknown mother thallus or complete living plant claim.",
